<title>UK: Wilcon yr pretax profits climb 17 percent.</title>
<headline>Wilcon yr pretax profits climb 17 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.0		    vs 8.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.44		   vs 3.18</p>
<p> Special div		5.0		    vs nil</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 9.8		    vs 4.54</p>
<p> Pretax		     26.4		   vs 22.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   300		    vs 245</p>
<p>NOTE -Full company name of the British housebuilder is Wilson (Connolly) Holdings Plc. The company said it proposed a special interim dividend of 5.0 pence in addition to its final dividend of 3.44 pence.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
